[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883325437","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120939#issuecomment-4883325437","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120939","id":4883325437,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIxGh_Q","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-04T18:02:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T18:06:11Z","body":"The material is shared across all gizmos so the update should happen once on the plugin level and not for every single used gizmo at the gizmo level. E.g. you could connect the plugin to the changed related signals of the server or projectsettings and update on that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883325437/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883556762","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120939#issuecomment-4883556762","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120939","id":4883556762,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIxUpmg","user":{"login":"GustJc","id":3084189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc","html_url":"https://github.com/GustJc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-04T19:27:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T19:27:27Z","body":"> The material is shared across all gizmos so the update should happen once on the plugin level and not for every single used gizmo at the gizmo level. \r\n\r\nI see what you mean. But I got stuck while trying to do that due to how **the material is handled internally**.\r\nThe create_material creates two materials. One for the selected material and another one for the unselected material.\r\n\r\nThe problem is the **get_material()** can only get the selected material if given a gizmo reference, which he uses the is_selected() to get the correct material from.\r\nOtherwise it will **always return the unselected material**. There is no alternative.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a3fc1cbcfb88e59935194b2a873f32789656125f/editor/scene/3d/node_3d_editor_gizmos.cpp#L1021-L1023\r\n\r\nEven setting the colors for the unselected material got a bit annoying. As it sets a *= 0.3 inside based on the create_material color. And there is no other function to update the colors barring creating the material again. So I updated the code to do this inside the redraw. \r\n\r\n---\r\nThe  alternative is recreating the material again with create_material() when the colors are changed. \r\nBut I think that's kinda worse, performance-wise.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883556762/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883660986","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120939#issuecomment-4883660986","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120939","id":4883660986,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIxbAug","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-04T20:07:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T20:07:39Z","body":"Copying the material would be worse. We just accept that the gizmo code gets in the way and spam updates I guess.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4883660986/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4894770443","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120939#issuecomment-4894770443","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120939","id":4894770443,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI8BFCw","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T15:45:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T15:45:20Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4894770443/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoteng